# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — libgtop 2.41.3: mountlist 读取回退 /proc/self/mounts
#     （OHOS/容器无 /etc/mtab）═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-09
# Software: libgtop 2.41.3
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-libgtop-mountlist-mtab-fallback
trigger_tool:           make|cc|runtime|test
phase:                  runtime|testing
error_signature:        Could not open /etc/mtab: No such file or directory|
                         glibtop_get_mountlist.*number=0|
                         setmntent.*/etc/mtab.*failed
severity:               2
category:               mountlist, /etc/mtab, /proc/self/mounts, filesystem,
                         ohos, containers, runtime
match_keywords:         mtab, /etc/mtab, /proc/self/mounts, mountlist,
                         setmntent, getmntent, mount table, containers,
                         read-only rootfs
title:                  OHOS/容器无 /etc/mtab 时 mountlist 为空：setmntent 回退
                         /proc/self/mounts 读取真实挂载
root_cause:             libgtop linux sysdeps 的 mountlist 用
                         setmntent(MOUNTED)（默认 /etc/mtab）读取挂载表；
                         OHOS 及精简容器系统不提供 /etc/mtab，open 失败 →
                         warn + 返回 0 挂载点，所有依赖 mountlist 的调用
                         （fsusage/disk 统计）静默为空。
affected_scope:         所有在 OHOS/容器（无 /etc/mtab）上读取挂载表的软件；
                         libgtop 消费者尤其受影响（无回退时 mountlist 恒空）。
verification_cmd:       cd archives/l/libgtop/2.41.3 && conan create . -pr:h=<ohos-aarch64> -pr:b=<ohos-aarch64> （test_package 鸿蒙专项测试断言 mountlist 139 mounts）
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           mtab-proc-self-mounts-fallback
rec_description:        setmntent(MOUNTED) 打开失败时回退 setmntent
                         ("/proc/self/mounts")（内核运行时挂载表，始终存在）；
                         仍失败才报错返回（patches/0002）。
rec_command:            (source patch sysdeps/linux/mountlist.c)
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               source-patch
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      link-mtab-symlink
fallback_description:   若无法改源码（非三方库），构建期创建 /etc/mtab →
                         /proc/self/mounts 符号链接（需写权限，属系统级）。
similar_to:             (无直接同族条目；E237 为 ACPI /proc 语义，非挂载表)